# Inventory Stock Movement
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Warehouse — a movement request that ledgers stock in or out, balance never negative
# Case 5 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: inventory-item.menata, inventory-stock-ledger.menata

Stock Movement

Fields

- Item : Item
- Movement Type : In | Out | Adjustment
- Quantity : Number
- Unit : PCS | KG | BOX | SAK | DOZEN
- Normalized Quantity : Number
- Requested Date : Date
- Movement Date : Date
- Notes : Rich Text
- Status : Requested | Confirmed

Events

When Confirm

    Movement Date Today

    if Movement Type = Out

        Item Stock On Hand must be greater than or equal to Normalized Quantity

    Create Stock Ledger Entry

    Status Confirmed

Constraints

- Item is required.
- Quantity is required.
- Quantity must be greater than 0.

    Movement Date must be on or after Requested Date.

    if Movement Type = Out

        Item Stock On Hand must be greater than or equal to Normalized Quantity

Permissions

Warehouse Staff

- Confirm

Views

- Movement Form : Form
- Pending Movements : List
- Movement Detail : Detail
